      "writtenOn": "2024-07-09T15:11:32Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I am unaware of any platform with 128-bit pointers or 16 byte pointer alignment requirement. SIMD data might be 16 byte aligned, but never `void*`. I\u0027m also pretty sure other parts of Skia are not compatible with 16 byte pointers. (e.g. Raster Pipeline?)",
      "parentUuid": "38f2d5fc_e8679555",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 56,
        "startChar": 57,
        "endLine": 56,
        "endChar": 82
      },
      "revId": "f6cb5c9a24312a65a3c8610901f98cd781215c61",
